   760	| `(y,x+y^5)` | `-1` | `(1,5)` | `c_2-u^5,u` | `(0,1,0,0,0)` |
   761	| `(y+x^2,x+(y+x^2)^2)` | `-1` | `(1,2)` | `c_2-u^2,u-(c_2-u^2)^2` | `(x^2,1)` |
   762	| `(x+y^5,y+(x+y^5)^3)` | `+1` | `(5,15)` | `u-(c_2-u^3)^5,c_2-u^3` | `A_0=x,A_5=1`, all others zero |
