+\[
+ \frac P2 < 6t+5\leq P,
+ \qquad
+ \frac35 <1\leq 3(6t+5).
+\]
+
+Their four positive margins are respectively
+
+\[
+ \frac{5t+4}{2},\qquad t+1,qquad \frac25,qquad 18t+14.
+\]
+
+Thus every implemented window holds for every \(t\geq0\).
+
+There are two scope qualifications.  First, the historical printed version of
+(1) contains the search cap \(n\leq100\), so only \(t=0\) lies literally under
