+| 3 | 243 | 80 | 36 / 36 / 44 | 207 / 80 / 0 | 243 / 80 / 0 |
+
+The raw Schur increments from the residual \(D_2\) block are
+\(0,2,23,44\); the top block adds no further rank because the witness has
