+### 3.2 Two six-disc orbits with identical lower data
+
+Let \(z=t^{1/12}\) and \(\zeta=\zeta_{12}\).  After subtracting the common
+outer terms in a bottom chart, a leading template for the two disc packets
+\(O=A,B\) is
