+and its orbit-admissible packet has \(k=18,N=9\).  It has 54 selected proper
+roots and 51 non-proper roots, split as 21 residual roots inside \(D_2\) and
+30 roots outside.  The blind local count \(2k=36\) versus 35 DEG slots gives
+\(-1\), hence “not overdetermined”; the completed report explicitly types this
