+# The \(A_2=6\) ray: fixed \(N=6\), first global moment pages, and the non-proper Schur interface
+
+Date: 2026-09-03  
+Lane: `a2six-ray-moment-sol56-20260903`  
+Status: **PROVED-HERE arithmetic and conditional linear algebra; UNREVIEWED witness geometry; full geometric interpolation OPEN**
+
+## Executive verdict
+
+The replacement ray is correct as an unbounded ray of the implemented numerical census.  For every integer \(t\geq 0\), put
+
+\[
+ P=7t+6,
+ \qquad (n,m)= (9P,6P),
+ \qquad M=(-6P,4P,9P-2),
+ \qquad (V_2,V_3)=(1,6t+5).
+\]
+
+Then
+
+\[
+ (\delta _3,\delta _2,\delta _1)=(-1,1/6,7/12),\qquad
+ (A_2,A_1)=(6,2),\qquad q=1/2,
+\]
+
+and the unique \(s=3\) packing problem admits copies of a six-disc nonzero
+orbit.  Two copies have \(k=12\) and \(N=6\) for every \(t\).  The exact
+census rows at \(D=n=54,117,180,243\) were re-emitted, and the \(D=117\)
+member is exactly the live row in `branch-orbits-v2`.
+
+The charged data determine the proper packets and aggregate root counts, but
+not the non-proper rooted tree, Galois action, tame support, or sharing required
+by `globalinterp.py`.  The frozen driver accordingly refuses the bare
+\(D=54\) skeleton:
+
+```text
+ERROR: decorated input must contain n=54 branches, got 0
+```
+
+Two conditional direct-moment projections were emitted instead.  Their exact
+ranks show a linearly growing proper-bottom defect and a witness non-proper
+repair.  The exact bottom functional
+\(Y^{K-1-3k}\prod_{\rm bot}(Y-\tau_i)\) begins at \(t=1\), but evaluates
+generically nonzero on non-proper columns.  Hence the defect is stable only on
+the bottom restriction.  The decisive interface is
+
+\[
+ S_t:\operatorname{gr}U_{\rm np}\longrightarrow
+ \operatorname{coker}(\operatorname{gr}A_{{\rm bot},t}).
+\]
+
+Two six-disc orbits with identical lower data exist.  Their rigid-star branches
+split into length-six and length-twelve orbits, so Galois descent gives four
+proper constants.  The requested \(C_A,C_B\) require two extra star-sharing
+equalities.  Full rank, tropical weights, and constants remain conditional
+until the non-proper decoration is supplied.
+
+No geometric realization, full `POLY`, full `NO-RESIDUE`, or cofinal
+obstruction is claimed.  No exit-price assertion is made.
+
