+Finally,
+
+\[
+ q=(1-\delta_1)\frac{de}{d+e}
+   =\frac5{12}\frac{2\cdot3}{5}=\frac12,
+\]
+
+where \((d,e)=(m/d_2,n/d_2)=(2,3)\), and
+
+\[
+ u=V_3d_2/d_3=18t+15.
