\[
 C_A^{(0)}=C_A^{(\pm)}=:C_A,
 \qquad
 C_B^{(0)}=C_B^{(\pm)}=:C_B.
\]

Then \(C_A\) and \(C_B\) are independent of each other.  The wrapper records
