kill equations (`global-interpolation-sol56-20260902.md:161-190`).

The direct value matrix is

\[
 A_{r,i}=\tau_i^r/D_i.
\]

It is not by itself the Jacobian from actual tame parameters to moments.  That
Jacobian also needs the integration equations, coefficient-sharing map, and
the complete root decoration.

### 4.2 First raw bottom orders

For a proper bottom branch, the displayed leading valuations are

\[
