+Again every weight changes, although the four displayed compositions remain
+the same.  This sensitivity is a direct counterexample to the claim that the
+charged numerical tuple alone determines a tropical basis or a closed-form
+minimum valuation.  It is not a counterexample to a future theorem formulated
+on a complete decorated skeleton.
