+ Q=V_3\frac{d_2}{d_3}=3(6t+5)=18t+15
+   =6(3t+2)+3.
+\]
+
+Thus \((\triangle_2,\square_2)=(3t+2,3)\).  Since \(V_2=1\), (10) holds
