+ \sum_{p_g(\pi)=0}\frac{p_f(\pi)}{p_g'(\pi)}=1,
+\quad
+ \sum_{p_g(\pi)=0}\frac{\pi p_f(\pi)}{p_g'(\pi)}=0,
+\quad
+ \sum_{p_g(\pi)=0}\frac{\pi^2p_f(\pi)}{p_g'(\pi)}=\frac13.
