+
+Basis compositions are ordered as
+`(proper, residual-inside-D2, top-minor)`.
+
+| \(t\) | \(D\) | completion A weight | A composition | completion B weight | B composition |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| 0 | 54 | \(467/12\) | (17,0,0) | \(621/16\) | (15,2,0) |
