+### 3.2 Two six-disc orbits with identical lower data
+
+Let \(\xi=x^{-1}\), \(z=\xi^{1/12}\), and \(\zeta=\zeta_{12}\).  Here \(z\)
+is the minimal displayed-radius uniformizer of the proper packet, not
