+## 3. The proper \(k=12\) decoration and the non-proper count
+
+### 3.1 The tree data actually forced
+
+Set
+
+\[
+ K=d_2=3P=21t+18,
+ \qquad e=n/K=3,
+ \qquad d=m/K=2,
