+| `OPEN[GEOMETRIC-REALIZATION]` | First member has \(D=54\), hence exactly 54 root series; no member is claimed realized. | Construct one \(D=54\) Keller-compatible decorated skeleton, validate all 54 branches and their cyclic action, then run `NO-RESIDUE`, DEG, and `POLY` through the first failing/surviving order. |
