+| 3 | 243 | \(10832/17\) | (24,56,0) | \(10566/17\) | (24,56,0) |
+
+Every weight changes.  At \(t=0\), even the minimizing composition changes.
+No listed minimum uses a top-minor column, but that is a feature of these two
