+Reproduction commands and the artifact map are in
+`box/a2six-drivers-20260903/README.md`.  The directory contains the driver,
+full JSON records, compact TSVs, manifest/refusal records, controls, and hashes.
+
+The final `SHA256SUMS` check passed for every listed artifact.
