 passes its bracket and trace checks.  `y^2-x^2-x` fails NO-RESIDUE at t-order
 1 with branch coefficients `+/-1/2`.  The partial five-of-six orbit exits 2
 with `REFUSED[PARTIAL-ORBIT]`.
