+  \(p_g'=d p_g/d\pi\); 1009, 1013, 1019 label characteristics.  Moment rows,
+  junction labels, and branch indices are not interchanged.
+- **Unused hazards:** no exit price, merge-free inference, or \(M\)-descent is
+  asserted.
